   "title": "How to use",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Clone Your Voice \u2014 ZONOS3-Mini\n\n1. **First time:** set `zonos3_folder` on **ZONOS3 Server** to the folder with `zonos3-server.exe`, and `model_folder` to the folder with `backbone-ptq.gguf`. The server then starts by itself. Already running it yourself? Leave both empty.\n2. In **Load Audio**, upload 10\u201330 seconds of your own voice: one speaker, no music, little background noise.\n3. Type your script in **ZONOS3 Text to Speech** and pick its language.\n4. Press **Run**. The result plays and is saved under `output/audio/ZONOS3`.\n\n**Tips**\n- Same seed = same take. Change the seed for another take.\n- *Voice profile* is steadier; *raw clip* can sound closer to the original.\n- Only clone your own voice, or a voice you have written permission to use."
   ]
  },
